{
  "pv": {
    "name": "Local Auth Architecture",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "markdown": ".principal-views/local-auth-architecture/local-auth-architecture.md",
    "nodeTypes": {
      "browser": {
        "label": "Browser",
        "description": "User's web browser"
      },
      "web-ade": {
        "label": "web-ade",
        "description": "Next.js app on localhost:3001"
      },
      "auth-server": {
        "label": "Auth Server",
        "description": "Auth server on localhost:3002"
      },
      "external": {
        "label": "External Service",
        "description": "External OAuth providers"
      },
      "storage": {
        "label": "Storage",
        "description": "Token/session storage"
      }
    },
    "edgeTypes": {
      "redirect": {
        "label": "Browser Redirect",
        "style": "dashed",
        "color": "#f59e0b"
      },
      "api-call": {
        "label": "API Call",
        "style": "solid",
        "color": "#3b82f6"
      },
      "server-to-server": {
        "label": "Server-to-Server",
        "style": "solid",
        "color": "#8b5cf6"
      },
      "cookie": {
        "label": "Cookie",
        "style": "dotted",
        "color": "#22c55e"
      }
    }
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "group-components",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 48,
      "y": 6,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "#334155",
      "label": "Local Development Components"
    },
    {
      "id": "browser",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Browser\n\nUser's browser on localhost",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 50,
      "width": 180,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "browser",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "fill": "#64748b",
        "stroke": "#475569"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "web-ade",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# web-ade\n\nlocalhost:3001\nNext.js App",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 50,
      "width": 180,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#3b82f6",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "web-ade",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "fill": "#3b82f6",
        "stroke": "#1d4ed8",
        "references": [
          "src/app/api/auth/login/route.ts",
          "src/app/api/auth/callback/route.ts",
          "src/app/api/auth/me/route.ts"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "auth-server",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Auth Server\n\nlocalhost:3002\nWorkOS + GitHub OAuth",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 50,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#8b5cf6",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "auth-server",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "fill": "#8b5cf6",
        "stroke": "#7c3aed"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "workos",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# WorkOS\n\nOAuth Provider",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 159,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "#f97316",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "external",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "fill": "#f97316",
        "stroke": "#ea580c"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "github",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# GitHub\n\nIdentity Provider",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "#171717",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "external",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "fill": "#171717",
        "stroke": "#404040"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "group-login-flow",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 49,
      "y": 344,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 500,
      "color": "#334155",
      "label": "Login Flow (PKCE)"
    },
    {
      "id": "step1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 1. User Clicks Login\n\nBrowser calls web-ade\n`/api/auth/login`",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 410,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "browser",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "fill": "#64748b"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 2. Generate PKCE\n\nweb-ade generates:\n- code_verifier\n- code_challenge\n- state (CSRF)",
      "x": 350,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#3b82f6",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "web-ade",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "fill": "#3b82f6",
        "references": [
          "src/lib/auth/pkce.ts",
          "src/app/api/auth/login/route.ts"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 3. Start OAuth\n\nauth-server calls\n`/api/auth/workos/start`\nReturns WorkOS auth URL",
      "x": 599,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#8b5cf6",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "auth-server",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "fill": "#8b5cf6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 4. OAuth Consent\n\nUser redirected to\nGitHub via WorkOS\nfor authorization",
      "x": 850,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 180,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#f97316",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "external",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "fill": "#f97316"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step5",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 5. OAuth Callback\n\nGitHub redirects to\nauth-server callback\nwith auth code",
      "x": 850,
      "y": 533,
      "width": 180,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#8b5cf6",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "auth-server",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "fill": "#8b5cf6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step6",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 6. Redirect to web-ade\n\nauth-server redirects to\nweb-ade `/api/auth/callback`\nwith state param",
      "x": 589,
      "y": 535,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#8b5cf6",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "auth-server",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "fill": "#8b5cf6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step7",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 7. Token Exchange\n\nweb-ade calls auth-server\n`/api/auth/workos/token`\n(server-to-server)\nwith PKCE verifier",
      "x": 589,
      "y": 679,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#3b82f6",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "web-ade",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "fill": "#3b82f6",
        "references": [
          "src/app/api/auth/callback/route.ts"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step8",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 8. Set Cookies\n\nweb-ade sets HTTP-only\ncookies on localhost:3001\n- github_token\n- workos_token\n- refresh_token",
      "x": 101,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#22c55e",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "web-ade",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "fill": "#22c55e",
        "references": [
          "src/lib/auth/cookies.ts"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "group-key-points",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 56,
      "y": 880,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "#334155",
      "label": "Key Points"
    },
    {
      "id": "key-cookies",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Cookie Scope\n\nCookies are scoped by **domain**, not port.\n`localhost:3001` and `localhost:3002`\nshare the same cookie jar.\n\nBUT - web-ade sets its own cookies,\nnot the auth-server.",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "#22c55e"
    },
    {
      "id": "key-pkce",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# PKCE Security\n\n- code_verifier stored in iron-session\n- Only web-ade knows the verifier\n- auth-server validates challenge\n- Prevents authorization code interception",
      "x": 380,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "#06b6d4"
    },
    {
      "id": "key-tokens",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Token Flow\n\n- Tokens returned server-to-server\n- Never exposed to browser JavaScript\n- HTTP-only cookies for security\n- Refresh token for session extension",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "#8b5cf6"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e-browser-webade",
      "fromNode": "browser",
      "toNode": "web-ade",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toSide": "left",
